 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I still have much to tell you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But you cannot bear it now",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The path is long and wide",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am going to the Father now",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the Spirit of truth comes",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will guide you gently",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will not speak on his own",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But speak whatever he hears",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will declare to you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The things that are coming",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Into all the truth he leads",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your heart is humming",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will glorify me",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Taking what is mine to speak",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All that the Father has",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is given to us to keep",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will declare to you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The things that are coming",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Into all the truth he leads",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your heart is humming",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A little while and you will lose sight",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And again a little while",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
